
== §6 — TRANSACTION LIFECYCLE ==
  ✓ a fresh project is IDLE
  ✓ beginning an edit enters DRAFT
  ✓ the draft pins the base revision
  ✓ a valid preview reaches PREVIEWED
  ✓ a valid transaction reaches VALIDATED
  ✓ the model is still untouched at VALIDATED
  ✓ an explicit commit reaches COMMITTED
  ✓ the returned project is a new object, not the old one
  ✓ the old project object still holds the old revision
  ✓ an invalid target reaches REJECTED
  ✓ a stale base revision reaches STALE_BASE_REVISION
  ✓ a dependency conflict reaches CONFLICT
  ✓ an unknown command reaches INVALID_COMMAND

