  ✓ the canonical model object is untouched after the preview
  ✓ the project revision did not move
  ✓ a visual preview built from the candidate differs from the base scene
  ✓ the preview visual scene compiles from the candidate, never from the canonical model
  ✓ cancelling returns to IDLE
  ✓ after cancelling, the current model hash is still H1
  ✓ cancelling leaves no pending command and no preview
  ✓ cancelling created no revision

