  ✓ the refused command is the fourth
  ✓ the commit changes nothing at all
  ✓ no revision was created
  ✓ the transaction declares itself atomic
  ✓ the same batch without the failing command commits as one revision
  ✓ all four edits landed in that single revision
  ✓ a batch beyond the declared cap is refused
  ✓ an empty transaction is refused
  ✓ a non-list transaction is refused

